---
import ControlDashboard from './ControlDashboard.astro';
---

<section class="mv2-control" id="mv2-controllo" aria-labelledby="mv2-control-title">
  <div class="mv2-control-canvas">
    <div class="mv2-control-aurora" aria-hidden="true">
      <span class="mv2-control-aurora-layer mv2-control-aurora-layer-a"></span>
      <span class="mv2-control-aurora-layer mv2-control-aurora-layer-b"></span>
      <span class="mv2-control-aurora-drift"></span>
      <svg class="mv2-control-aurora-lines" viewBox="0 0 1200 720" preserveAspectRatio="none" focusable="false">
        <path d="M-60 518C180 430 360 366 620 334S1010 286 1260 152" />
        <path d="M-40 606C220 528 430 470 700 432S1080 372 1280 262" />
        <path d="M118 720C320 604 520 526 760 476S1120 424 1320 336" />
      </svg>
    </div>

    <div class="mv2-control-shell">
      <div class="mv2-control-copy">
        <p class="mv2-kicker" data-mv2-reveal="up">AUTOMAZIONE CON CONTROLLO</p>
        <h2 id="mv2-control-title" data-mv2-reveal="title">L’assistente aiuta.<br /><em>Il team decide.</em></h2>
        <p data-mv2-reveal="up" data-mv2-delay="2">Le risposte partono dalle informazioni e dalle regole della tua attività. Quando una richiesta richiede attenzione, una persona può prendere in carico la conversazione.</p>
        <a class="mv2-text-link mv2-light-link" href="#mv2-showcase" data-mv2-reveal="up" data-mv2-delay="3">Esplora il pannello <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div>

      <div class="mv2-control-stage" data-mv2-control-stage>
        <ControlDashboard />
        <ul class="mv2-control-cards">
          <li class="mv2-control-card mv2-control-card-1">
            <div class="mv2-control-card-inner">
              <span class="mv2-control-avatar is-warn" aria-hidden="true">M</span>
              <div class="mv2-control-card-body">
                <h3>Richiesta da verificare</h3>
                <p>La risposta per Giulia Rossi è pronta per la verifica.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="mv2-control-card-meta">
                <span class="mv2-control-chip">Da verificare</span>
                <span class="mv2-control-time">18:21</span>
              </div>
              <p class="mv2-control-card-foot">Disponibilità tavoli · orari di servizio</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="mv2-control-card mv2-control-card-2">
            <div class="mv2-control-card-inner">
              <span class="mv2-control-avatar is-info" aria-hidden="true">L</span>
              <div class="mv2-control-card-body">
                <h3>Team in conversazione</h3>
                <p>Una persona prende in carico la conversazione quando necessario.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="mv2-control-card-meta">
                <span class="mv2-control-chip">Al team</span>
                <span class="mv2-control-time">18:19</span>
              </div>
              <p class="mv2-control-card-foot">
                <span class="mv2-control-card-mini" aria-hidden="true">LF</span>
                Luca Ferri · Operatore
              </p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="mv2-control-card mv2-control-card-3">
            <div class="mv2-control-card-inner">
              <span class="mv2-control-avatar" aria-hidden="true">G</span>
              <div class="mv2-control-card-body">
                <h3>Approvazione manuale richiesta</h3>
              </div>
              <div class="mv2-control-card-meta">
                <span class="mv2-control-time">18:22</span>
              </div>
              <p class="mv2-control-card-quote">La prenotazione richiede una conferma manuale del team.</p>
              <div class="mv2-control-card-foot mv2-control-card-foot-detail">
                <svg class="mv2-control-card-icon" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
                  <rect x="2.5" y="3.5" width="11" height="10" rx="2" />
                  <path d="M2.5 6.5h11M5.5 2.5v2M10.5 2.5v2" />
                </svg>
                <div class="mv2-control-card-booking">
                  <span class="mv2-control-card-booking-title">Prenotazione #24891</span>
                  <span class="mv2-control-card-booking-meta">Venerdì · 20:30 · 2 persone</span>
                </div>
                <div class="mv2-control-card-actions" aria-hidden="true">
                  <span class="mv2-control-card-action">Rifiuta</span>
                  <span class="mv2-control-card-action is-strong">Approva</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="mv2-control-label">Esempio illustrativo</p>
</section>
